  "job_B3.2.19_20251003_114618": {
    "text": "De Passione Domini Men \u00f0a leofestan, gehira\u00f0 nu hu drihten w\u00e6s sprecende on \u00feas tid to his geferum, &\n\u00dea hi \u00fea gegadorode w\u00e6ron \u00fea bisceopas & \u00fea ealdormen \u00fe\u00e6s folces in anum cafertune, & se bisceop\n\u00dea didon hi swi\u00fee micele \u00feeahtunge imbe urne h\u00e6lend, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine woldon mid inwitte beswican to \u00feam\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don sume \u00fea men, Eala, nelle we on \u00feisne simbeld\u00e6g, \u00fei l\u00e6s wen sy \u00fe\u00e6t micel ungerec si on\nMid \u00fei \u00fei h\u00e6lend w\u00e6s in Bethania lande, on Simones huse \u00fe\u00e6s untruman, \u00fea geeode him an wif to, seo\n\u00dea geat heo hit ofer \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes heafod be him sittendun.\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon his gingeran, \u00fea wurdon hi swi\u00fee unrote, & hi cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6t is \u00feeos farlorenes \u00fe\u00e6t\nHw\u00e6t, heo \u00feis mahte on micel weor\u00f0 becypan & \u00feonne \u00feearfendum mannum ged\u00e6lan.\n\u00dea wiste hira ge\u00feancas, & cy\u00fe\u00fea to him, Hw\u00e6t is eow unea\u00f0e \u00e6t \u00feissum wife?\nHw\u00e6t, heo w\u00e6s god worc wircende on me.\nSimble ge habba\u00f0 \u00feearfan mid eow, ac ge ne habba\u00f0 me simble.\n\u00de\u00e6t heo dide minum lichoman to smirenesse.\nAnd heo bicnede \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde beon on byrgenne aleged.\nSo\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feis godspell bi\u00f0 inne r\u00e6d geond ealle middangeard, bi\u00f0 hire gemindwur\u00feig\n\u00dea eode an of his XII geongerum, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Iudas Scario\u00f0, iode to \u00feara sacerda ealdormannum, &\nHi \u00fea ealle anmodlice him togenes oncw\u00e6don, We \u00fee gesilla\u00f0 XXX scillinga on silfre.\nAnd \u00fea \u00feanon \u00fea sohte he \u00fea gelimplican tide \u00fe\u00e6t he hine let to dea\u00f0e gesillan.\n\u00dea se h\u00e6lend \u00e6t \u00e6fengereordum s\u00e6t mid his twelf geonrum, ongan \u00fea sprecan to his geongrum, & he\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a gehirdon his geongeran, \u00fea wurdon hie swi\u00f0e geunrotsode, & \u00e6lc cw\u00e6\u00f0 sundorlice, Drihten,\n\u00dea answarode him h\u00e6lend & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Se \u00fee me mid his handum hrine\u00f0, swa hit be him awriten is, on\n\u00deonne se mannes sunu g\u00e6\u00f0, wala \u00feam men \u00fee mannes sunu gesealdne hafa\u00f0.\nSelre him w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he na n\u00e6re.\n\u00d0a si\u00fees\u00f0 andswarode him se Iuda se \u00f0e hine gesealdne h\u00e6fde, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, S\u00e6gest \u00feu, lareow, \u00fe\u00e6t ic\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him h\u00e6lend to, \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t cw\u00e6de.\nHe \u00fea h\u00e6lend to \u00feam \u00e6fengereordum anfeng hlafe, & \u00feone gebletsode, & tobr\u00e6c, & sealde his\nAnd he onfeng kalice, & gebletsode win of w\u00e6tere, & sealde his geongerum, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, drinca\u00f0 ge ealle\nSo\u00f0 is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic ne drince for\u00f0heonone an \u00feisse m\u00e6\u00f0e \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee ic eft mid eow\nAnd hi \u00fea drihtene lof sungon & s\u00e6gdon, & ferdon in \u00fea dune \u00fee is nemned Montem Olifete.\n\u00dea ongan h\u00e6lend spr\u00ebcan to his geongerum & he swa cw\u00e6\u00f0, So\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t eow secge, ealle ge me do\u00f0\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Petrus, \u00feeah hie \u00fee ealle geswicen, ic ana \u00fee n\u00e6fre ne swice.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him h\u00e6lend to, So\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0e secge, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me ons\u00e6cest on \u00feisse nihte \u00feriwa \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee se\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft Petrus to, Hw\u00e6t, me gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic swelte mid \u00fee \u00feonne ic \u00fee ons\u00e6ce.\nEac swa ilce ealle his geongeran \u00fe\u00e6t cw\u00e6don.\n\u00dea cwom h\u00e6lend on \u00feone tun \u00fee is gietsamani genemned, \u00fea ongan he spr\u00ebcan to his geongerum, & he\nGenam him \u00fea Petrus mid & Sebe\u00f0\u00e6ges suna twegen, ongan \u00fea sona swi\u00fee unrotsian & an swi\u00f0e\nAnd \u00fea eode he lythwon from him, & feoll \u00f0a ofer his anwlitan, & geb\u00e6d hine \u00feissum wordum, & he\nAnd \u00fea cwom h\u00e6lend to his geongerum & mette hi sl\u00e6pende, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea to Sancte Petre, Forhwon\nWacia\u00f0 ge nu, & gebidda\u00f0 eow \u00fei l\u00e6s ge gegangen on deofles anweald.\nAnd he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Min gast is swi\u00f0e fuus & min lichoma untrum.\nFeoll \u00f0a eft ofer his andwlitan & geb\u00e6d hine mid \u00feam ylcan wordum.\n\u00dea eode he \u00e6ft o\u00fere si\u00f0e, & geb\u00e6d hine, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif \u00fee ie\u00f0e sy, gewite \u00feeos \u00ferowung fram me, sy\nCom \u00f0a eft to his gingrum & mette hie sl\u00e6pende, for\u00feon \u00fee hi w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee gehefgude mid \u00fe\u00e6re\nEode \u00fea \u00f0riddan si\u00f0e & geb\u00e6d hine mid \u00feam ylcan wordum.\nCwom \u00fea eft to his gingerum, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Slapa\u00f0 ge nu \u00fea, & r\u00e6sta\u00f0 eow, for\u00feon nu neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 seo\nArisa\u00f0 nu, & utun gaan, for\u00feon \u00fee nu neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 se \u00f0e me gesealdne h\u00e6f\u00f0.\n\u00d0a eode se Iuda ut, & he hine l\u00e6dde to \u00fean ungeafullan heap Iudea folces \u00fea w\u00e6ron mid sweordum &\n\u00dea sealde se Iuda him \u00fe\u00e6t to beacne, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Witon ge \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee ic cessende beon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t is se\n\u00dea w\u00e6s an stow \u00fee h\u00e6lend lufode sundorlice \u00fea f\u00e6stentid.\n\u00dea wolde he \u00fea stowe gegan \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee hi hine namon.\n\u00dea he him eft to geeode, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him h\u00e6lend to, Hw\u00e6t seca\u00f0 ge?\n\u00deane Natarenisca h\u00e6lend.\nTo so\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6t eom.\n\u00dea urnon hi underb\u00e6c & afeollon, & he eode for\u00f0, singende his gingeran.\n\u00dea hie him to geeodun, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft h\u00e6lend to, Hw\u00e6ne seca\u00f0 ge?\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don hie, \u00feisne h\u00e6lend, \u00feone galileiscan h\u00e6lend.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, So\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6t eom.\n\u00dea urnon hie o\u00f0re si\u00f0e underb\u00e6c & afeollon.\nAnd he eode for\u00f0 singende, & fulleode \u00fea stowe \u00fee he to wolde \u00e6r his \u00ferowunge.\n\u00dea \u00feriddan si\u00f0e \u00fea geeode him se Iuda to, se \u00fee hine gesealdne h\u00e6fde, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Aue rabbi, &\nCyste hine \u00fea mid \u00feam worde.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him H\u00e6lend to, Amice, et quod uenisti; He cw\u00e6\u00f0, To hw\u00e6s com \u00feu endemes hider nu \u00feus?\n\u00dea setton hie hira handa on \u00feone H\u00e6lend, & hie hine namon, & hie hine bundon.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s an H\u00e6lendes gingra \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Petrus.\n\u00dea gebr\u00e6d he his sweorde & asloh anes \u00feara sacerda ealdormannes \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0re eare of, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s\n\u00dea cigde him H\u00e6lend \u00feone Malhcum to, & geh\u00e6lde his eare.\nAnd he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Petre, Petrus, hwirfe \u00fein sweurd on \u00feine sc\u00e6\u00fee, swilc eowre swilce w\u00e6pne anfeh\u00f0 to\nWenstu \u00fe\u00e6t ic ne meahte abiddan \u00e6t minum f\u00e6der XII eored engla gif ic feohtan wolde?\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend to \u00feam folce, Hw\u00e6t, ge earme comon to me swa to o\u00ferum scea\u00fean, mid\nHu, ne s\u00e6t ic \u00e6lce d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6stentid on eowrum temple & eow l\u00e6rde?\nAnd hwon ne namon ge me \u00fe\u00e6r?\nAc \u00fea gewritu sculon beon gefillede, \u00fea be me awritene w\u00e6ron.\nEalle his gingran hie hine farflugon & forleton, swa \u00fe\u00e6t sceapheorde de\u00f0 \u00feonne him wulf on becim\u00f0.\nPetrus ana he him folgade feorran, & he w\u00e6s ingangende in on \u00feone cafertun \u00fea \u00feara sacerda\n\u00dea \u00f0\u00e6ra sacerda ealdormen hi sohton swi\u00f0e lease gewitnesse wi\u00f0 H\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine woldon mid\n\u00dea comon \u00fe\u00e6r twegen ungemetlease, \u00f0a cw\u00e6don hie, Eart \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u gulpe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u meahtest godes\nH\u00e6lend, he swigode.\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to \u00feara sacerda ealdorman, Ac forhwon ne geandswarast \u00feu us \u00e6t sumum worde?\nHw\u00e6t, \u00feu gehierst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e man micela spr\u00e6ca to h\u00e6f\u00f0 & micela gewitnessa to s\u00e6i\u00f0.\nAnd H\u00e6lend he swigode.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft to \u00feara sacerda ealdorman, Ic \u00fee halsie, under lifiendne god, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu cwe\u00fee gid \u00f0u sie\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him H\u00e6lend to, \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t cw\u00e6de.\nSo\u00f0 is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gesiehst git mannes sunu lifiende on \u00fea swi\u00f0ran healfe his\n\u00deara sacerda ealderman he slat his agen hr\u00e6gl on him silfum, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feis is yfelsacung eallenga,\nHw\u00e6t, hit is eow gesewen & swa cweden.\nAnd hie \u00fea ealle andswaredon, \u00fe\u00e6t Iudisce folc his rices, \u00f0a andswaredon hie & cw\u00e6don, He is dea\u00f0es\nSume hie spiwon ofor his andwlitan, sume hie slogon bradum handum on his neb, sume hine mid\nHe swigode.\nPetrus he eode near & wolde geseon on hwam H\u00e6lendes \u00feing w\u00e6re.\n\u00dea geeode him an man to & cu\u00e6\u00f0, Eart \u00feu her mid \u00feis Nazareniscan H\u00e6lende?\nAnd he \u00fea \u00e6rest o\u00f0soc beforan him eallum & swa cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nat ic hw\u00e6t \u00feu s\u00e6gest.\n\u00dea eode eft hwene near on o\u00fere stowe & wolde geseon on hwam \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes \u00feing w\u00e6re.\n\u00dea geeode him to o\u00feer mennen, & cu\u00e6\u00f0, Eart \u00feu her mid \u00feies H\u00e6lendan Criste, \u00feis galea cyninge?\n\u00dea mid swi\u00fee micelre a\u00f0sware he hine ladude \u00f0a \u00feriddan si\u00f0e.\n\u00dea geeode him to se Malhcus \u00fee he \u00e6r on d\u00e6g gewundode, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se, Eart \u00feu se Petrus se se me\nHu, ne gecnawe ic \u00fee full geare?\nAnd \u00fein spr\u00e6c \u00fee hafa\u00f0 cu\u00f0ne gedon.\n\u00dea mid swi\u00fee micelre a\u00f0sware he hine ladude & he cw\u00e6d, Ne can ic \u00feone mannan, ne ic \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00dea \u00ebfter lytlum f\u00e6ce, \u00fea sang se hana.\n\u00dea was Petrus gemindi \u00feara wurda \u00fee H\u00e6lend him \u00e6r to spr\u00e6c; \u00e6r \u00feam \u00fee se hana singe, \u00feriwa \u00feu\nAnd eode \u00fea ut of \u00feam kafertune & weop swi\u00f0e biterlice.\nOn mergenne, \u00feam gewurdenum \u00feingum, \u00fea didon hie micele ge\u00feeahtunge ymbe urne H\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t hie\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t geseah se Iuda \u00fee hine gesealdne h\u00e6fde, \u00fe\u00e6t he swa swi\u00f0e gescyldod w\u00e6s, \u00fea w\u00e6s he to\n\u00dea andswaredon hie, & hi cw\u00e6don, Hw\u00e6t s\u00e6gest \u00feu nu us \u00fe\u00e6s?\nHw\u00e6t magon we his \u00fee nu don?\n\u00dea genam he \u00fe\u00e6t XXX scillenga & forwearp on hira tempel, & he arn & aheng hine silfne.\n\u00dea \u00f0\u00e6ra sacerda ealdermen didon swi\u00f0e micele ge\u00feeahtunge ymb \u00fe\u00e6t sealfor, & hie cw\u00e6don, Hu ne\n\u00dea gewer\u00f0 hi ealle \u00fe\u00e6t hy gebohton \u00fe\u00e6t land mid \u00fee is nemned Acheldemah.\n\u00de\u00e6t land hie to \u00feon gebohton \u00fe\u00e6t el\u00f0eodigra manna lichoman on byridon.\nH\u00e6lend he stod beforan \u00feam gerefan, & he hine ahsode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eart \u00feu Iudea kining?\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him H\u00e6lend to, \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t cw\u00e6de.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s folces gewuna fram \u00f0am edm\u00e6ld\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t him mon simle anne forgeafe \u00feara \u00fee \u00feonne on\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6r hie twegen on bendum, o\u00feer w\u00e6s Barabba se scea\u00fea, o\u00feer w\u00e6s H\u00e6lend.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to Pilatus, Hw\u00e6\u00feerne \u00feissa tuegea wille ge \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow forgyfe \u00fee \u00feisne Barabban \u00fee\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don hie, Barabban.\nAc hw\u00e6t wite ge \u00feissum H\u00e6lende se is genemned Crist?\nEalle hie cigdon & cw\u00e6don, Sie he ahungen.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him se refa to, Hw\u00e6t h\u00e6f\u00f0 he to yfle gedon?\nHi cigdon micele swi\u00f0or to & cw\u00e6don, Si he ahangen.\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t geseah Pilatus, \u00fe\u00e6t him nan wiht ne gespeow, ac swa he fur\u00feur spr\u00e6c, swa hie mare unger\u00ebc\n\u00dea onfeng Pilatus w\u00e6tere & ongan \u00fewean his handa, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic wille beon unscildig \u00feeses so\u00f0f\u00e6stan\nHe licette mid his tungan & sirede inwit mid his heortan.\n\u00dea andswarodon hie & cw\u00e6don, Si his blod ofor us & ufer ure bearn.\nAnd \u00fea forgeaf he him Barabban, & H\u00e6lend he him ageaf beswongenne to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t hie hine on rode\nAnd \u00fea cempan him onfengon, & hie hine l\u00e6ddon to hira moterne, & hie hine ongyredon his agenum\nAnd mid hreode hi hine slogon, & gebigdon cnewum hie hine bismeroden.\nAnd \u00feirnenne coronan hi didon him on heafud, & hie cw\u00e6don, Hal westu, Iudea kining.\n\u00c6fter \u00feon \u00fee hie hine swa gebysmerodne h\u00e6fdon, \u00fea ongyredon hie hine \u00fey hr\u00e6gle & hi hine\n\u00dea metton hie \u00e6nne Cyriscmannan \u00fe\u00e6s nama wes Simonem, \u00feone hi namon & niddon hine to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd hio is on Ebrisc Caluarie genemned.\nSona \u00fea hie \u00fe\u00e6der comon, \u00fea sealdon hie him eced wi\u00f0 geallan gemenged to drincanne.\n\u00c6fter \u00feam \u00fee he w\u00e6s on rode ahangen, \u00fea d\u00e6ldon hie his hr\u00e6gl & sendon hliete ofer his hr\u00e6gl.\nAnd \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fee he w\u00e6s on rode ahangen, \u00fea w\u00e6s se cwide gefelled \u00fee se sealmscopwirhta cw\u00e6\u00f0,\nHie d\u00e6ldon min hr\u00e6gl, & hie sendon hlietas ofor min hr\u00e6gl.\nAnd \u00fea asettan hie \u00fe